{"seq":1,"slug":"controversies","title":"争议","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/seneca/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wealth-versus-philosophy","title":"财富与哲学之争","url":"/c/people/seneca/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/wealth-versus-philosophy","wordCount":2612,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"serving-nero","title":"辅佐尼禄之争","url":"/c/people/seneca/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/serving-nero","wordCount":2358,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"# 争议\n\n本章客观地呈现围绕塞内卡的主要争议。塞内卡巨额的财富与其看淡财富的哲学之间的矛盾，以及他辅佐暴君尼禄的经历，是评价他时不可回避的争议。两篇文档，分别呈现财富与哲学之争，以及辅佐尼禄之争，力求客观而全面。\n"}